==Strategy==
Due to Wicked Cat's high speed, you can stop meatshielding for a second and easily lure it to the base. Use heavy hitters to continuously knock back the cat, and after you kill it, the support should be no problem on their own. 3 meatshields ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] or [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] if you haven't beaten that yet) should be enough to stall. Bring something like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] to tank the sloth's hits, although it isn't necessary due to how easy this stage is.

